        "section_width": "fluid_container",
        "color_scheme": "default",
        "custom_liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  DIY Vape Shop · Bloque de descripción de colección\n  Sección: templates/collection.json → custom_liquid_8hxMrp\n  Revisión 2026-08-25 · Fix de indexabilidad y visibilidad\n\n  CAMBIO DE FONDO\n  ---------------\n  Antes: .diy-content-outer { max-height: 0; opacity: 0 }\n  El 100% del copy SEO de las 124 colecciones quedaba oculto tras un clic.\n  Google lo indexaba con menor peso y ningún usuario lo veía, así que no\n  podía aportar ni a CTR ni a señales de interacción.\n\n  Ahora: el contenido se renderiza VISIBLE por defecto, recortado a una\n  altura de asomo (--diy-peek) con degradado de corte. El botón expande el\n  resto. Nada se oculta: solo se recorta visualmente.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n{%- if collection.description != blank -%}\n<style>\n  .diy-collapsible-wrap {\n    --lab-red:  #C8102E;\n    --carbon:   #0A0A0A;\n    --bone:     #F5F2EC;\n    --steel:    #B8B4AC;\n    --diy-peek: 260px;\n    background: var(--carbon);\n    border-radius: 2px;\n    padding: 0;\n    position: relative;\n    margin: 2rem 0;\n    border-left: 3px solid var(--lab-red);\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Contenido: visible por defecto, recortado ---------- */\n  .diy-content-outer {\n    overflow: hidden;\n    max-height: var(--diy-peek);\n    opacity: 1;\n    position: relative;\n    transition: max-height 0.42s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n  }\n  .diy-content-outer::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;\n    height: 96px;\n    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(10, 10, 10, 0) 0%, var(--carbon) 92%);\n    pointer-events: none;\n    opacity: 1;\n    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;\n  }\n  .diy-collapsible-wrap.open .diy-content-outer::after { opacity: 0; }\n  .diy-content-inner { padding: 24px 28px 8px; line-height: 1.8; }\n\n  /* Si el texto cabe entero, se elimina el recorte y el control */\n  .diy-collapsible-wrap.diy-full .diy-content-outer { max-height: none; }\n  .diy-collapsible-wrap.diy-full .diy-content-outer::after { display: none; }\n  .diy-collapsible-wrap.diy-full .diy-toggle-btn { display: none; }\n  .diy-collapsible-wrap.diy-full .diy-content-inner { padding-bottom: 24px; }\n\n  /* ---------- Control (ahora abajo: el texto va primero) ---------- */\n  .diy-toggle-btn {\n    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 16px; width: 100%; background: none; border: none;\n    border-top: 1px solid #1f1f1f;\n    padding: 18px 24px 18px 28px; cursor: pointer; text-align: left;\n    transition: background 0.2s;\n    font: inherit;\n  }\n  .diy-toggle-btn:hover { background: rgba(200, 16, 46, 0.06); }\n  .diy-toggle-btn:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--lab-red); outline-offset: -2px; }\n  .diy-eyebrow {\n    font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--lab-red);\n    display: block; margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .diy-title-text {\n    font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--bone);\n    line-height: 1.4; transition: color 0.2s; display: block;\n  }\n  .diy-toggle-btn:hover .diy-title-text { color: #FFFFFF; }\n  .diy-label-more { display: inline; }\n  .diy-label-less { display: none; }\n  .diy-collapsible-wrap.open .diy-label-more { display: none; }\n  .diy-collapsible-wrap.open .diy-label-less { display: inline; }\n\n  .diy-icon {\n    flex-shrink: 0; width: 26px; height: 26px;\n    border: 1px solid #2e2e2e; border-radius: 50%;\n    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n    position: relative; transition: border-color 0.2s;\n  }\n  .diy-toggle-btn:hover .diy-icon,\n  .diy-collapsible-wrap.open .diy-icon { border-color: var(--lab-red); }\n  .diy-icon-bar {\n    position: absolute; background: #555; border-radius: 1px;\n    transition: transform 0.28s ease, opacity 0.28s ease, background 0.2s;\n  }\n  .diy-icon-bar.h { width: 10px; height: 1.5px; }\n  .diy-icon-bar.v { width: 1.5px; height: 10px; }\n  .diy-toggle-btn:hover .diy-icon-bar,\n  .diy-collapsible-wrap.open .diy-icon-bar { background: var(--lab-red); }\n  .diy-collapsible-wrap.open .diy-icon-bar.v { transform: rotate(90deg); opacity: 0; }\n\n  /* ---------- Tipografía del rich text ---------- */\n  .diy-divider {\n    display: block; height: 1px; margin-bottom: 20px; opacity: 0.5;\n    background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--lab-red) 0%, #2a0008 60%, transparent 100%);\n  }\n  .diy-rich-text * { color: var(--steel); }\n  .diy-rich-text h1, .diy-rich-text h2 {\n    font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--bone);\n    margin: 0 0 14px; line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n  .diy-rich-text h3 {\n    font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--bone);\n    margin: 22px 0 10px; line-height: 1.35;\n  }\n  .diy-rich-text h4 {\n    font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--bone);\n    margin: 18px 0 8px; line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n  .diy-rich-text p { color: var(--steel); margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 14px; }\n  .diy-rich-text p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n  .diy-rich-text a {\n    color: var(--lab-red);\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    text-underline-offset: 3px;\n  }\n  .diy-rich-text a:hover { color: #ff2040; }\n  .diy-rich-text strong, .diy-rich-text b { color: var(--bone); font-weight: 600; }\n  .diy-rich-text ul, .diy-rich-text ol {\n    color: var(--steel); padding-left: 18px; margin: 0 0 12px;\n  }\n  .diy-rich-text li { color: var(--steel); margin-bottom: 4px; }\n\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    .diy-content-outer, .diy-content-outer::after, .diy-icon-bar { transition: none; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n{%- comment -%} Sin JS el recorte se anula: el texto nunca queda inaccesible. {%- endcomment -%}\n<noscript>\n  <style>\n    .diy-content-outer { max-height: none !important; }\n    .diy-content-outer::after { display: none !important; }\n    .diy-toggle-btn { display: none !important; }\n    .diy-content-inner { padding-bottom: 24px !important; }\n  </style>\n</noscript>\n\n<div class=\"diy-collapsible-wrap\" data-diy-collapsible>\n  <div\n    class=\"diy-content-outer\"\n    id=\"diyContent-{{ collection.id }}\"\n    role=\"region\"\n    aria-labelledby=\"diyToggle-{{ collection.id }}\"\n  >\n    <div class=\"diy-content-inner\">\n      <span class=\"diy-divider\"></span>\n      <div class=\"diy-rich-text\">\n        {{ collection.description }}\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <button\n    type=\"button\"\n    class=\"diy-toggle-btn\"\n    id=\"diyToggle-{{ collection.id }}\"\n    aria-expanded=\"false\"\n    aria-controls=\"diyContent-{{ collection.id }}\"\n  >\n    <span>\n      <span class=\"diy-eyebrow\">DIY Vape Shop · Guía de colección</span>\n      <span class=\"diy-title-text\">\n        <span class=\"diy-label-more\">\n          Seguir leyendo sobre\n          <span style=\"color:var(--lab-red);\">{{ collection.title }}</span>\n          y todo lo relacionado con el mundo del vapeo\n        </span>\n        <span class=\"diy-label-less\">Mostrar menos</span>\n      </span>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"diy-icon\">\n      <span class=\"diy-icon-bar h\"></span>\n      <span class=\"diy-icon-bar v\"></span>\n    </span>\n  </button>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  (function () {\n    if (window.__diyCollapsibleReady) return;\n    window.__diyCollapsibleReady = true;\n\n    function peekOf(wrap) {\n      var v = getComputedStyle(wrap).getPropertyValue('--diy-peek');\n      return parseInt(v, 10) || 260;\n    }\n\n    function toggle(wrap) {\n      var btn = wrap.querySelector('.diy-toggle-btn');\n      var box = wrap.querySelector('.diy-content-outer');\n      if (!btn || !box) return;\n      var isOpen = wrap.classList.contains('open');\n\n      // Punto de partida medible para poder animar desde/hacia 'none'\n      box.style.maxHeight = box.scrollHeight + 'px';\n\n      if (isOpen) {\n        requestAnimationFrame(function () {\n          wrap.classList.remove('open');\n          btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');\n          box.style.maxHeight = peekOf(wrap) + 'px';\n        });\n      } else {\n        wrap.classList.add('open');\n        btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');\n        box.addEventListener('transitionend', function () {\n          if (wrap.classList.contains('open')) box.style.maxHeight = 'none';\n        }, { once: true });\n      }\n    }\n\n    document.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n      var btn = e.target && e.target.closest ? e.target.closest('.diy-toggle-btn') : null;\n      if (!btn) return;\n      var wrap = btn.closest('[data-diy-collapsible]');\n      if (wrap) toggle(wrap);\n    });\n\n    // Si el texto ya cabe entero, se retira el recorte y el control.\n    function measure() {\n      var wraps = document.querySelectorAll('[data-diy-collapsible]');\n      for (var i = 0; i < wraps.length; i++) {\n        var wrap = wraps[i];\n        if (wrap.classList.contains('open')) continue;\n        var box = wrap.querySelector('.diy-content-outer');\n        if (!box) continue;\n        wrap.classList.toggle('diy-full', box.scrollHeight <= peekOf(wrap) + 24);\n      }\n    }\n\n    if (document.readyState === 'loading') {\n      document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', measure);\n    } else {\n      measure();\n    }\n    window.addEventListener('load', measure);\n    window.addEventListener('resize', function () {\n      clearTimeout(window.__diyCollapsibleT);\n      window.__diyCollapsibleT = setTimeout(measure, 200);\n    });\n  })();\n</script>\n{%- endif -%}",
        "padding_top": 30,
